{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3fb","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a895-af1e-7030-b7a0-b39b63843e96"},"sequence":88,"recorded_at":1780531400000171,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a895-ed42-79b2-9437-a3bd24f87a63"},"task_id":"01a0a895-ed42-79b2-9437-a3bd24f87a63","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a895-ed42-79b2-9437-a3bd24f87a63","chunk":"Read text file `.spec/README.md`.\n1|# RunnerControl specs\n2|\n3|Materialized from approved-design.md for STORY-260916-36d1jg. Registration and\n4|removal are in scope for this release (promoted from \"next stage\" in §2).\n5|\n6|- `github-login-device-flow.md` — GitHub App Device Flow, Keychain, refresh, installations/repos.\n7|- `management-window.md` — native 760×540 window, tabs, menu coexistence.\n8|- `runner-registration.md` — new-runner wizard (implements TASK-260916-13diw4 contract).\n9|- `runner-removal.md` — remove-from-app vs delete-from-GitHub boundary.\n10|- `offline-local-control.md` — offline/401/403/rate-limit behavior.\n11|\n12|Conventions: Relux actor services, state/reducer/flow, Container+Page. No UI\n13|tests. Generator input (`ios-app-manager.json`) owns scaffold output; never\n14|hand-edit `Project.swift`/`Package.swift`.","final_result":true}}}
