{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3ff","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a895-af1e-7030-b7a0-b39b63843e96"},"sequence":90,"recorded_at":1780531400000175,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a895-ecdd-7692-92b9-1ebcc7a0650e"},"task_id":"01a0a895-ecdd-7692-92b9-1ebcc7a0650e","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a895-ecdd-7692-92b9-1ebcc7a0650e","chunk":"Read text file `.spec/runner-removal.md`.\n1|# Runner removal (in scope for this release)\n2|\n3|## Two operations (never confused)\n4|\n5|1. **Убрать из приложения**: deletes only the catalog entry (directory\n6|   record). Warns if the service keeps running. Deletes no files, no GitHub\n7|   registration, no certificates. Implemented with the catalog slice\n8|   (TASK-260916-304bw2).\n9|2. **Удалить runner из GitHub**: separate future scenario using\n10|   registration/remove tokens. Not the same button; requires explicit scope\n11|   and confirmation.\n12|\n13|## Rules\n14|\n15|- Removing from the app never stops, unregisters, or deletes the working\n16|  installation.\n17|- A removed-then-readded directory reuses discovery validation\n18|  (canonical path dedupe, no double import via symlink).\n19|- UI copy must name which operation runs; destructive GitHub removal needs\n20|  typed confirmation and shows the exact scope/registration ID.","final_result":true}}}
{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c401","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a895-af1e-7030-b7a0-b39b63843e96"},"sequence":91,"recorded_at":1780531400000177,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a895-ecdd-7692-92b9-1ebcc7a0650e"},"task_id":"01a0a895-ecdd-7692-92b9-1ebcc7a0650e","event":{"kind":"completed","task_id":"01a0a895-ecdd-7692-92b9-1ebcc7a0650e"}}}
{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c403","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a895-af1e-7030-b7a0-b39b63843e96"},"sequence":92,"recorded_at":1780531400000179,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332"},"call_id":"call_01a0a895e7c8718089867232c9809efe","text":"Read text file `.spec/runner-registration.md`.\n1|# Runner registration (in scope for this release)\n2|\n3|Promoted from §2 \"next stage\" into this release. Implemented by\n4|TASK-260916-13diw4; this slice provides login + installation/repo selection\n5|that the wizard consumes.\n6|\n7|## Scope\n8|\n9|- Wizard downloads the architecture-matched official runner, verifies\n10|  integrity, installs to a no-space path, obtains a scoped short-lived\n11|  registration token, runs exact `config.sh` invocation, sets up\n12|  `runsvc.sh` + manual LaunchAgent, retries idempotently with recovery.\n13|- Org registration uses a dedicated per-Mac group + selected repo access;\n14|  personal repos get separate installations. Repo access and labels remain\n15|  editable; real IDs are fetched; permission errors are retained.\n16|- Never mutates unrelated/shared groups without explicit UI scope.\n17|\n18|## Preconditions (this slice)\n19|\n20|- `GitHubAuth` connected with installations + selected repos.\n21|- Required elevation (later): Self-hosted runners/write (org) or\n22|  Administration/write (repo) + matching user rights. Absence blocks the\n23|  wizard step with the concrete missing permission, not a generic error.\n24|\n25|## Safety\n26|\n27|- No auto-transfer of a running runner; relocation is a separate stopped\n28|  operation with restore.\n29|- No second controlling process; validate manifest + `.runner` + binaries +\n30|  no-space paths immediately before action.\n31|- Registration tokens are short-lived, Keychain-only, never logged.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c405","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a895-af1e-7030-b7a0-b39b63843e96"},"sequence":93,"recorded_at":1780531400000181,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a6dbad5b-a9c9-418a-a77b-cbe6123a6332"},"call_id":"call_01a0a895e8607007827851c510a81fb5","text":"Read text file `.spec/runner-removal.md`.\n1|# Runner removal (in scope for this release)\n2|\n3|## Two operations (never confused)\n4|\n5|1. **Убрать из приложения**: deletes only the catalog entry (directory\n6|   record). Warns if the service keeps running. Deletes no files, no GitHub\n7|   registration, no certificates. Implemented with the catalog slice\n8|   (TASK-260916-304bw2).\n9|2. **Удалить runner из GitHub**: separate future scenario using\n10|   registration/remove tokens. Not the same button; requires explicit scope\n11|   and confirmation.\n12|\n13|## Rules\n14|\n15|- Removing from the app never stops, unregisters, or deletes the working\n16|  installation.\n17|- A removed-then-readded directory reuses discovery validation\n18|  (canonical path dedupe, no double import via symlink).\n19|- UI copy must name which operation runs; destructive GitHub removal needs\n20|  typed confirmation and shows the exact scope/registration ID.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
